  "id": "hostile-work-environment",
  "term": "hostile work environment",
  "definition": "A hostile work environment is a workplace climate shaped by ongoing discrimination, racism, microaggressions, stigma, or bias that undermines a person’s well-being and ability to progress at work. In this packet, it refers especially to conditions that harm Black professionals’ mental and physical health, job satisfaction, retention, and career development.",
